  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nComplements [#840](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/840) (`research/dyadic-query-pair`), which fuses two completed DATA shears for dyadic powers `a=\u00b12^j` with an all-odd-radix lowering and leaves non-dyadic powers to introduce prime exclusions. This freestanding package fixes the odd kernel to **3**, takes `a=\u00b13\u00b72^j`, and prices the same three-query fusion with every excluded modulus named.\n\n```text\nx <- h^-a x\nx ^= y\nx <- h^(2a) x\nx ^= y\nx <- h^-a x\n```\n\n| Complete cost item | Separate pair | Fused odd-kernel pair |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Ordinary recursive children | 4 | 3 |\n| Ordered affine events | 24 | 18 |\n| Aligned XOR scans | 4 | 2 |\n| Extra full private rows | 0 | 0 |\n\nThe lowering specializes to every **odd modulus not divisible by 3**. Multiples of 3 and even rings are rejected. These are exact interface counts, not measured runtime.\n\n**Research construction / recursive interface; no new kappa.** Leave-alone tooling through [#2487](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2487) and pending `mutable-source-789q-invoice` were not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/triadic-query-pair/`.\nTip: `77041f2d139276115ffa32ab876455d3a58ef2cb`.\n\nExact invoice **children 4\u21923; affine 24\u219218; XOR 4\u21922** with named exclusions (`excluded_moduli=11` in the verify receipt) and independent matrix checks.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/triadic-query-pair/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/triadic-query-pair/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/triadic-query-pair/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/triadic-query-pair/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/triadic-query-pair\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_TRIADIC_QUERY_PAIR children 4->3; affine 24->18; XOR 4->2; kernel=3 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_TRIADIC_QUERY_PAIR children=4->3 xor=4->2 kernel=3 ...\nPASS_TRIADIC_QUERY_PAIR_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=5\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/triadic-query-pair outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()` (not `assert`); `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#840](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/840) dyadic all-odd-radix case (does not price kernel-3 non-dyadic lowering). Leave-alone through [#2487](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2487). No competing open PR on this freestanding package at refresh.\n\nCredit Wentao Li / PR840 and the retained PR521/PR677 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
